# A fictional civic office considers handicap cards for Alice and Bob.
# Alice's request is allowed; Bob's explicit hold creates a prohibition and
# a permission/prohibition conflict. The LE snapshot uses the same ODRL
# validation and evaluation LS as handicap-card.ttl with --odrl.
# These criteria are illustrative, not law. ODRL model and vocabulary:
# https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-model/ and https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/

Use ODRL snapshot logic with namespace "https://example.org/handicap-card#".

# Select both policies and requests, with prohibitions winning across policies.
evaluation is an evaluation.
evaluation has policy eligibility and evaluation has policy administrativeHold.
evaluation has request issueAlice and evaluation has request issueBob.
evaluation has conflictStrategy prohibit.

# The permission requires an approved assessment and verified residence.
eligibility is a policy.
eligibility has profile snapshotProfile and eligibility has permission mayIssue.
mayIssue is a permission.
mayIssue has assignee CivicOffice and mayIssue has action issueHandicapCard.
mayIssue has target HandicapCardService.
mayIssue has constraint approved and mayIssue has constraint resident.
approved is a constraint.
approved has leftOperand assessmentApproved and approved has operator eq.
approved has rightOperand true.
resident is a constraint.
resident has leftOperand residenceVerified and resident has operator eq.
resident has rightOperand true.

# An explicit hold activates the prohibition.
administrativeHold is a policy.
administrativeHold has profile snapshotProfile and administrativeHold has prohibition mustWait.
mustWait is a prohibition.
mustWait has assignee CivicOffice and mustWait has action issueHandicapCard.
mustWait has target HandicapCardService and mustWait has constraint held.
held is a constraint.
held has leftOperand administrativeHold and held has operator eq.
held has rightOperand true.

# Each request reads its own person's state; a missing observation is unknown.
issueAlice is a request.
issueAlice has assignee CivicOffice and issueAlice has action issueHandicapCard.
issueAlice has target HandicapCardService.
issueAlice has subject Alice and issueAlice has state aliceState.
aliceState is a state.
aliceState has subject Alice.
aliceState has assessmentApproved true and aliceState has residenceVerified true.
aliceState has administrativeHold false.

issueBob is a request.
issueBob has assignee CivicOffice and issueBob has action issueHandicapCard.
issueBob has target HandicapCardService.
issueBob has subject Bob and issueBob has state bobState.
bobState is a state.
bobState has subject Bob.
bobState has assessmentApproved true and bobState has residenceVerified true.
bobState has administrativeHold true.
